// Opsin - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// Opsin parses IUPAC chemical names into structures. It has no
// greeting because "Hello World!" is not a chemical name, and
// the file says so rather than inventing a molecule.
// OPSIN("Hello World!") -> ParseException
